sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 前端/API 调用方
    participant API as /api/ai 端点
    participant NR as ai_noise_reduce
    participant AIS as AiService
    participant AS as AuditService
    participant DB as SQLite<br/>(ai_audit_log)

    Note over Client,DB: P0 #1: ai_noise_reduce 审计链路（修复后）

    Client->>API: POST /api/ai/noise-reduce
    API->>NR: noise_reduce(case_id, host_id)
    NR->>NR: build_events_summary(events)
    NR->>AIS: call_llm(audit_context={endpoint:"noise_reduce", intent:"ai_noise_reduce", ...})
    activate AIS
    AIS->>AIS: 记录开始时间
    AIS->>AIS: _do_llm_request() → HTTP POST
    AIS->>AIS: 计算耗时
    alt 成功
        AIS->>AS: log_call(status="success", endpoint="noise_reduce", ...)
        AS->>DB: INSERT INTO ai_audit_log
        DB-->>AS: OK
        AS-->>AIS: OK
        AIS-->>NR: 返回 LLM 响应
    else 失败
        AIS->>AS: log_call(status="failed", error_message="...", endpoint="noise_reduce", ...)
        AS->>DB: INSERT INTO ai_audit_log
        DB-->>AS: OK
        AIS-->>NR: 抛出异常
        NR->>NR: 回退到 mock
    end
    deactivate AIS
    NR->>NR: save_results(verdicts)
    NR-->>API: 返回统计
    API-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,DB: P0 #2: AiService.call_llm 统一审计

    Client->>API: POST /api/ai/narrate-incident
    API->>AIS: call_llm(audit_context={endpoint:"narrate", ...})
    AIS->>AS: log_call(...)
    AS->>DB: INSERT INTO ai_audit_log

    Note over Client,DB: P1 #4: 查询扩展筛选条件

    Client->>API: GET /audit-logs?endpoint=noise_reduce&keyword=断路器
    API->>AS: query_logs(endpoint="noise_reduce", keyword="断路器")
    AS->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE endpoint=? AND (prompt LIKE ? OR ...)
    DB-->>AS: 筛选后的日志列表
    AS-->>API: 返回分页结果
    API-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,DB: P2 #7: Token 统计分组

    Client->>API: GET /stats/tokens?days=30&group_by=endpoint
    API->>TSS: get_daily_stats(days=30, group_by="endpoint")
    TSS->>DB: SELECT DATE, endpoint, SUM(...) GROUP BY DATE, endpoint
    DB-->>TSS: 分组统计结果
    TSS-->>API: 返回
    API-->>Client: 200 OK
